00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:06.316
I wish I was already, like, a 85.
- Right.
- Yeah.

00:01:06.524 --> 00:01:08.234
- I don't think I can get you to that.
- Yeah.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.278
